msgctxt "80"
msgid ""
"Okay! I'm all set! Just let me know whenever you're ready,\r\n"
"too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"Oh, by the way, I remembered something from my pro\r\n"
"wrestling days. Maybe it'll help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"An all-out victory is not the way to the audience's heart.\r\n"
"You've got to almost lose, and then make a comeback. It\r\n"
"never fails!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"However amazing you may look, if you lose the match\r\n"
"right off the bat, the fans will never remember you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"You may impress the fans with a finishing move, but just\r\n"
"make sure one isn't used on you! All the attention will go\r\n"
"to your opponent."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "I'll let you know if I remember anything else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"Needless to say, though, if you don't end up winning, all\r\n"
"your effort will have been in vain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "I'll let you know if I remember anything else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"The first rule of thumb is to keep yourself in front of\r\n"
"the audience for as long as you can."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "I'll let you know if I remember anything else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"Okay! I'm all set! Just let me know whenever you're ready,\r\n"
"too. Just seeing the audience gets me all excited!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid ""
"By the way, the more popular you are with the audience here,\r\n"
"the higher your reward. Popularity was all-important in\r\n"
"pro wrestling, too."
msgstr ""

